// 2. Wait (or send load):
sleep 60
// 3. Take another snapshot:
curl http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/heap > heap2.out
// 4. Compare:
go tool pprof -base=heap1.out heap2.out
(pprof) top  # shows what grew between snapshots

